 concerns March 24, 2026, when Oregon State Police and a United States Fore=
st Service special agent were sent
 to my residence behind a locked federal gate, on the one-year anniversary =
of my dismissal, with no crime alleged and no action taken.</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Robot=
