I have released everyone else. I released the 42 U.S.C. =A7 1983 claim agai=
nst the Program Manager unconditionally and in writing on July 8, 2026. The=
 names of the four local employees have been removed from the public archiv=
e and will not be restored. I have
 declined to pursue the United States Forest Service. I am not pursuing any=
one for the conduct that preceded March 24.</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Robot=
