What remains is one act with one author: the person who conveyed my date of=
 birth and my location and caused armed officers to be sent to where I live=
. The Oregon State Police dispatch record contains my date of birth entered=
 on March 24, ten days before I
 first provided it to that agency. The District Ranger for the Central Coas=
t Ranger District has stated in writing that the Forest Service did not ini=
tiate the interview. One question remains in this matter. It will be answer=
ed by the records process or under
 oath.</div>
